<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.1000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.1000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.1000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday after 74.9000 on Thursday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Mar 21		  Mar 20</p>
<p> High			     74.9600		 74.8600</p>
<p> Low				75.1000		 75.0500</p>
<p> Open			     75.0000		 75.0500</p>
<p> Close			    75.1000		 74.9000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  4.980		   6.300</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
